/E (The primary logo should be used in black when placed on white or light-colored backgrounds. This ensures maximum contrast, clarity, and brand legibility across digital and print applications. The black logo is the default and preferred version for most use cases, including websites, documents, presentations, and stationery. No effects, shadows, gradients, or opacity changes should be applied to the logo in this usage.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
291 0 obj
